{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_44_1588924746#1_3284427237","relevance":3,"reason":"The result is dedicated to baiting/social engineering and directly explains that attackers lure victims with attractive offers playing on fear, greed, and temptation, relying on psychological manipulation to make victims disclose sensitive data or take harmful actions.","learned":"A cybercrime can appeal to a victim by presenting an attractive bait that exploits fear, greed, or temptation to manipulate the victim into revealing confidential information or enabling further crime."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1991","reason":"The current query continues to return direct grade-3 evidence explaining cybercrime appeals through psychological manipulation, trust, fear, greed, and temptation, so continue for more strong results."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1991"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_26_1678228016#5_2927236815","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1991","rank":14,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_26_1678228016#5_2927236815\" , \"end_char\": 2658.000000 , \"headings\": \"Security + Practice Test 2 Security + Practice Test 2 PLAY Key concepts: Terms in this set (25) THIS SET IS OFTEN IN FOLDERS WITH... Security + Practice Test 1 Security + Practice Test 4 Security + Practice Test 3 Test 5 \" , \"segment\": \"Web browsers 1. <cover>Urgency 3. Authority 5. Intimidation Which social engineering principles apply to the following attack scenario? ( Select 3 answers) An attacker impersonates a company's managing staff member to manipulate a lower rank employee into disclosing confidential data. The attacker informs the victim </cover>that the information is essential for a task that needs to be completed within the business hours on the same day and mentions potential financial losses for the company in case the victim refuses to comply. 1. Urgency 2. Familiarity 3. Authority 4.\" , \"start_char\": 2099.000000 , \"title\": \"Security + Practice Test 2 Flashcards | Quizlet\" , \"url\": \"https://quizlet.com/296952838/security-practice-test-"}}
