{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_749830055#5_1726169046","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment from the IFF Lab social-engineering techniques page, but it directly explains that baiting exploits a victim's tendency to react to bait that attracts greed or curiosity, luring victims into a trap to steal personal information or infect systems with malware.","learned":"Repeated evidence: cybercrime appeals to victims by using bait that attracts greed or curiosity so the victim falls into a trap involving data theft or malware."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1994","reason":"The focused social-engineering lure query is producing direct grade-3 evidence about cybercrime appealing to victims through greed and curiosity, so continue within the remaining judgment budget."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1994"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_749830055#16_1726191149","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1994","rank":3,"snippet":"5. Be Cautious of Foreign Offers How to Protect Yourself from Social Engineering Attacks? Incognito Forensic Foundation (IFF Lab) – Your Awareness & Diagnostic Partner Contact us for Awareness Programs and Investigation Services. \" , \"segment\": \"The victim receives an email declaring him/her as the winner of a sweepstake that promises an attractive sum of money. The sender of the email then asks the victim to call a particular number or click on the link provided. The victim’s <cover>greed for the lottery win often lures him/her to disclose sensitive bank details to the conman. Source: http://www.euromillions.co/lottery-scams/ 5. Quid Pro Quo In this social engineering technique, miscreants lure victims </cover>with favors or benefits in exchange for something, usually information. Remember that if the offer sounds too good to be true, it might be nothing more than a trap! Example: The perpetrator impersonates an IT support technician and calls the target victim. He assures the victim of a quick technical fix.\" , \"start_char\": 7186.000000 , \"title\": \"Top 5 Social Engineering Attack Techniques Used by Cyber Criminals\" , \"url"}}
